mensions of 7.44 x 0.05 x 9.69 inches.\"}, {\"book_id\": \"bookid_19\", \"title\": \"Business Associations: Agency, Partnerships, LLCs, and Corporations- 2013 Statutes and Rules\", \"details\": \"The book, published by Foundation Press in its 2013th edition on March 22, 2013, is available in English and spans 355 pages. It has an ISBN-10 number of 1609303687 and an ISBN-13 number of 978-1609303686. Weighing 1.5 pounds, the book's dimensions are 7 inches in width, 0.5 inches in thickness, and 9.75 inches in height.\"}, {\"book_id\": \"bookid_20\", \"title\": \"Inspector Imanishi Investigates (Soho Crime)\", \"details\": \"The book, published by Soho Crime in a revised edition on July 1, 2003, is available in English and has a total print length of 372 pages. It has a file size of 2295 KB and supports various features such as Text to Speech, a screen reader, enhanced typesetting, X-Ray, Word Wise, and sticky notes on Kindle Scribe.\"}, {\"book_id\": \"bookid_21\", \"title\": \"Officially Dead\", \"details\": \"The book, published by Random House in its first edition on January 1, 1945, is written in English and weighs 12 ounces.\"}, {\"book_id\": \"bookid_22\", \"title\": \"Dine In!\", \"details\": \"This book, published by KCTS Television on March 6, 2006, is written in English and features a spiral-bound format with 100 pages. It has an ISBN-10 of 0974028622 and an ISBN-13 of 978-0974028620. The item weighs 2.15 pounds.\"}, {\"book_id\": \"bookid_23\", \"title\": \"The Promise of Love (The Book of Love)\", \"details\": \"This book, published independently on July 1, 2021, is written in English and is available in paperback with a total of 230 pages. It has an ISBN number of 979-8530009297 and weighs 14.4 ounces. The dimensions of the book are 6 x 0.52 x 9 inches.\"}, {\"book_id\": \"bookid_24\", \"title\": \"Statesmen of the Lost Cause\", \"details\": \"This book, published by Little Brown in its first edition on January 1, 1939, is available in English. It has an I